		{
			dependencies: ["15ACD993630984F4"]
			description: [
				"When you open a crafting table for the first time, you'll be met with some new values. These are Eterna, Quanta, and Arcana. They are your primary attributes, and values you'll learn more of as you progress."
				"{image:tumblrbumblr:textures/quests/enchanting.png width:156 height:90 align:center}"
			]
