			title: "Arcana"
			x: 1.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["44A41664198FD457"]
			description: [
				"In addition to the primary three attributes is &o&6Rectification&r. This is an extra attribute that lessens the negative chances of &o&6Quanta&r. Put simply, &6&omore Rectification is always good and increases the consistency of more powerful enchantments.&r"
				"One way to increase Rectification outside of bookshelves is &o&6by placing Amethyst Clusters nearby.&r"
			]
			id: "4990D952610404AF"
			rewards: [{
				amount: 100L
