		{
			dependencies: ["0626E825BC0B0B77"]
			description: [
				"30 levels is all that's achievable using regular bookshelves. If you want to go further, &o&6you'll need to start crafting more special bookshelves&r."
				"&6&oHellshelves&r and &o&6Seashelves&r are special bookshelves made with materials from The Nether and The Ocean respectively. Hellshelves will give extra &oQuanta&r while Seashelves will instead give &oArcana&r."
				"&6&oUsing these bookshelves, you can reach enchantment level 45.&r"
				"{image:tumblrbumblr:textures/quests/hellshelf_and_seashelf.png width:156 height:90 align:center}"
