		{
			dependencies: ["2F2C58A19EE524BD"]
			description: [
				"You've reached level 45, good. Now it's time to learn about &6&oInfusing&r."
				"Infusing is essentially enchanting a block, typically a bookshelf. Unlike regular enchanting, &o&6infusing requires specific amounts of Eterna, Quanta, and Arcana&r. Usually you only need to have at least the required amounts, but there are some cases where you must have less than a specific amount."
				"&6&oUsing Infused Bookshelves, you will be able to reach Level 54 enchantments. But there is more to be done with them.&r"
				"{image:tumblrbumblr:textures/quests/infusing.png width:156 height:90 align:center}"
